[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0009","text":"采访者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0010","text":"那么，关于下一场演唱会，\n我们想听听CoMETIK两位的想法"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0019","text":"采访者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0020","text":"我也有很多不了解的地方，如果有说得不对的\n地方，请尽管指出来哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0030","text":"好的！／请多指教……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0039","text":"采访者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0040","text":"那么首先，想请教一下关于大家的氛围\n既然是偶像组合，果然关系很好吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0049","text":"路加的粉丝"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0050","text":"什么CoMETIK啊————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0059","text":"路加的粉丝"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0060","text":"那不是路加……那种东西————\n路加也不愿意的吧……是被迫的吧……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0069","text":"采访者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0070","text":"演唱会临近的话，应该会和成员们有很多共处的时间，\n一起活动开心吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0080","text":"是、是的……！\n非常开心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0090","text":"我也很开心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0098","text":"采访者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0100","text":"是吧……！\n那你们平时会三个人一起去吃饭什么的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0110","text":"那，那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0119","text":"采访者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0120","text":"要挑战活动的话，不互相理解、\n心不连在一起是做不好的吧——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0129","text":"采访者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0130","text":"在这样相处的过程中，\n也会感受到彼此之间的联系吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0140","text":"联系……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0142","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0150","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0160","text":"那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0161","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0162","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0169","text":"采访者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0170","text":"虽然今天不在，路加小姐喜欢什么样的\n东西呢？　如果有什么小故事的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0180","text":"那，那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0190","text":"……我还\n不太了解……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0199","text":"SNS的帖子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_00_0200","text":"『不需要CoMETIK』"}]
